{"articleNo":"3056","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3056&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 동기방학 중 부서별 근로장학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.12.12","hit":"9769","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 방학중 부서별 근로장학생 배정 현황1.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3056&attachNo=2499"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2011학년도 동기방학 중 근로장학생 신청 안내</span></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2011학년도 동기방학 중 근로장학생 신청 안내를 하오니 희망학생은 기한 내에&nbsp; 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(희망부서는 첨부파일참고)<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 국가 근로장학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 자격 및 선발요건 : 재학생 중 한국장학재단 근로장학생 추천된 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 근로기간 : 2011. 12. 22(목) ~ 2012. 02. 29(수) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 근로부서 : 붙임</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로장학생 희망부서 근무 신청[직접방문 또는 전화] (12. 13(화) ~ 12. 15(목)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">18:00까지)</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> → 근로장학생 희망부서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">온라인신청</span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">[근무부서와<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;협의 완료 후</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청] → 근로장학생 선발 확정(12. 20(화))</span></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">온라인신청</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘근로장학생 신청서<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제출’에서 희망근무부서 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 완료[별도<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;서류 제출 없음]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 근로장학금액</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교내근로 : 시간당 급여 6,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전공관련산업체 : 시간당 급여 8,000원<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 대학 근로장학생 (학생식당)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 자격요건 : 재학생 중 직전학기 평점평균 1.6이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 근로기간 : 2011. 12. 22(목) ~ 2012. 02. 29(수) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 근로부서 : 붙임</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로장학생 신청서 제출</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">’에서&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청서 작성 및 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">희망근무부서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 신청서 인쇄 -&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">를</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 희망근무부서로 제출</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(12. 13(화) ~ 12. 15(목) 18:00까지)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> -&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 근로장학생 선발 확정(12. 20(화))<br>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;마. 근로장학금액 : 시간당 급여 6,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;가. 학기초과자 및 휴학자는 신청불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 근로시간은 근무 부서에 따라 다름</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;다. 계절학기 수업과 근로시간이 중복불가<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 054-478-7065(학생처)<br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp; 2011학년도 방학 중 부서별 근로장학생 배정 현황 1부.<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2011. 12. 12.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학 생 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
